      "content": "Marsh gate survey\n\nProcedure MG-023 | Revision 2 | Station M-0042\n\nRecord the route of water before opening the demonstration gate.\n\n1. Intake\n\n1.1 Field preparation\n\n1.1.1 Marker checks\n\n1. Match marker M-0042 to the intake register.\n\na. Read the final two digits aloud; do not shorten 0042 to 42.\n\n2. Place ruler R-0006 against the lower sill.\n\n1.2 Route\n\nInlet Gate M-0042 Outlet\n\nFigure 1. Water route; arrows show the observed direction.\n\nNote 1. The route is descriptive; gate opening requires a separate permit.\n\nMG-023 / 1",
