      "content": "2. Verification\n\n2.1 Marker checks\n\nRepeat the marker reading at the outlet and retain both observations.\n\nTable 1. Verification readings\n\nMarker Depth (cm)\n\nM-0042 0\n\nM-0108 12.5\n\nM-0110 --\n\nStatus\n\nDry at intake\n\nOutlet flowing\n\nNot observed\n\nTable note. -- means no observation; it is different from depth 0 cm.\n\n2.2 Disposition\n\n1. Keep the gate closed if either reading is missing.\n\n2. File the card with Procedure MG-023, revision 2.\n\nReference: Survey register SR-0019, section 4 (synthetic internal reference).\n\nMG-023 / 2",
